github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99134.patch","merged_at":"2024-11-13T14:39:16Z"},"body":"- Supersedes #85968\r\n- Supersedes #98907\r\n\r\nAs discussed in this RocketChat thread[^1], the bump to Ubuntu 22.04 for our GitHub Actions have raised the lower bounds of support for both Python and SCons. As our current minimum versions for both (3.1.2 for SCons & 3.6 for Python) are *well* into EOL as-is, it feels ideal to bump the versions in tandem. In contrast to previous PRs trying to have other changes in tandem, this is *strictly* focused on bumping the minimum versions\r\n\r\nImmediate benefits include:\r\n- Having a minimum Python version that matches the minimum supported version for mypy.\r\n- Bumping Ruff's minimum version to 3.8 as well, now matching versions\r\n- Single baseline OS for Linux builds\r\n\r\n[^1]:https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/buildsystem?msg=Wuq39TCvaHTSiSAuL","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99134/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,